# Final hostile-audit disposition

The chain above was independently rechecked after removing the duplicated `c_B=0`
source. Binding corrections are carried directly in the text:

- §129 uses `area(unit rhombus)<=1`, not the false `sqrt(3)/2` cap;
- §141 uses the cross-distance ray-order argument, not the invalid “common wedge fixes
  order” sentence.

Sections §§131–133 retain occurrence multiplicity, do not identify contact-isolated
points with positive-core vertices, and do not extend the Section-57 affine kernel to
isolated coordinates. §147 is conditional only on the named audited-working ledgers.

None of §§128–133, 141, or 147 addresses the macroscopic inactive-container branch or
produces a same-cardinality strict sub-`D` competitor.

**Overall verdict:** PASS at audited-working proof-only scope. Canonical theorem-state
authority remains audit.46; C-II and Level I remain open.